# Simon Sinek

Simon Sinek is a leadership author and motivational speaker known for popularizing the concept of "Start With Why." His work emphasizes understanding the motivations and needs of others as a foundation for effective leadership.

## Key Works Referenced

- **Leaders Eat Last** — Focuses on creating environments of trust and safety where people feel empowered to take risks and support one another
- **Find Your Why** — Guides individuals and organizations in discovering their purpose to better align with and understand others
- **The Infinite Game** — Frames leadership as an infinite game rather than a finite one, connecting to the existing [[simon-sinek]] page

## Connections

Sinek's ideas about understanding others' motivations connect to the [[Others]] mental model, [[leaders-eat-last---simon-sinek]], and [[find-your-why---simon-sinek]]. His work on trust and purpose aligns with themes in [[communication-skills]] and [[decision-culture]].
